    "header.ultracodeHint" : {
      "comment" : "Session header › Model pill and sheet. Ultracode cost — the same sentence as the server's `ULTRACODE_CHANGE_NOTE`. VoiceOver hears it at the Ultracode row and at Apply with only ultracode; it does not stand on screen. Quotes the sheet title and the “No” segment exactly.",
